ACT VI OF 1995
ACT VI OF 1995
ZIAUDDIN MEDICAL UNIVERSITY ACT, 1995
CHAPTER‑III
OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
6. Officers of the University.‑‑The following shall
be the Officers of the University‑‑‑
(i) the Chancellor;
(ii) the Rector;
(iii) the Pro‑Chancellor;
(iv) the Vice‑Chancellor;
(v) the Deans;
(vi) the Director of the Teaching Department;
(vii) the Registrar;
(viii) the Controller of Examination;
(ix) Director Finance, and
(x) Such other persons as may be prescribed by
regulations.
